--!strict
-- WorldLayout (v2): the whole island city of Hotwire City as data. Design doc: docs/v2/world/WORLD_SPEC.md,
-- migration from Config/Map + Util/MapLayout: docs/v2/world/MIGRATION.md. Runtime queries: Util/WorldQuery.
--
-- Pure and deterministic: no Instances, no services, no Random. The hand-authored parts (coastline, terrain
-- features, freeway corridors, arterials, hill roads, POIs, plots, landmarks) are plain tables below; repetitive
-- parts (district street grids, interchanges, lots, parking spots) are generated by code in this module with
-- Util/WorldGen. The result is built once, on first require, into the exported tables:
--
--   Scale, SEA_LEVEL, GRADE, Bounds          real-scale constants (1 stud ~= 0.28 m) and the world box
--   Coast, Islands, Water, Channel            coastline polygons (segment kinds), inland water, the Rust River channel
--   TerrainZones                              named terrain regions (basin, beach, hills, canyon, desert, mesas...)
--   heightAt(x, z) / gradeAt(x, z)            terrain surface / smooth grade (no channel carve) at any XZ
--   Districts                                 polygons + style keys, height ranges, density, lot rules
--   Nodes, Edges                              the road graph (explicit; multi-level: freeway decks, flyovers, channel)
--   Intersections                             junction nodes with control (signal / stop / merge) and signal phases
--   Parcels                                   building lots (oriented rects, use, target height) for the builders
--   POIs, Plots                               named places (shops, banks, police, hospitals...) and the 8 garages
--   Spawns                                    street parking, police, traffic edges, hospital respawns, default
--   Landmarks, HotDrops, StuntJumps, Helipads, SafeZones, RestrictedZones
--   Routes                                    armored-truck runs and race routes (polylines on the graph)
--   Rails, Paths, Bridges, LevelCrossings     extra geometry for the builders and NPCs
--
-- Axes: +X east, -Z north (map up), +Y up. Right-hand traffic. Heights: sea level 0, city grade 12.

